t-rex-converter (1.0.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sidebar redesign: the ~30 flat entries are now grouped into eight
    collapsible categories (Image, Video, Audio, Document, PDF, Subtitle,
    Archive, Utility) via a tree, with clean rounded selection (no stray
    accent bar in the indent column).
  * Tabs restyled from pill/buttons to a flat underline style across all
    tab bars (page tabs and per-page option tabs): the active tab is marked
    by an accent underline on a single baseline.
  * Spin (increment/decrement) buttons on number fields now render proper
    caret arrows that fit the rounded field, instead of broken default
    boxes (caret images shipped in assets/, paths injected at runtime).
  * Settings: conversion defaults (image quality, audio bitrate, OCR
    language & render DPI, video CRF & x264 preset) now actually seed the
    matching conversion pages — previously they were saved but unused.
    Added a "System & maintenance" section (version, config/settings paths,
    open config/output folder, restore defaults).
  * About: enriched with the engine list, tech stack, privacy note and
    project links; the version is now read from the package metadata
    (a single source of truth via app.__version__) instead of a stale
    hard-coded string.
  * Transparent app icons (no white box behind the logo).

